  {t="C", q=712, name="Study of the Elements: Rock", gv="Collect", gw="Bracers of Rock Binding", optional=true, z=3, x=17.03, y=84.3, note="Collect Bracers of Rock Binding", tip="Every rock elemental in the Badlands drops Jarkal's shards: the Lesser Rock Elementals (37) on the flats west of Lotwil's camp are the safe ones, about one kill in five. Only the Greater Rock Elementals (42-44, well above you) in the south-western gulches drop Lotwil's bracers, also about one kill in five: pull one at a time and rest between fights, or leave them. Keep killing coyotes and buzzards you still need on the way.", section="Arathi Highlands & Badlands (36-38)", zoneName="Badlands", p=952, place="The Dustbowl: kill these as you meet them"}, -- 2692
