  {t="FP", text="Marshal's Refuge flight path", tip="From the Broken Pillar ride west to the long ramp that winds down into Un'Goro Crater, then follow the crater's north wall to Marshal's Refuge, a camp in the cliff caves. Everyone here is neutral.", section="Un'Goro Crater, Eastern Plaguelands & Burning Steppes (51-53)", p=1311, place="Into Un'Goro Crater"}, -- 3574
